1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,900
Meridian Solar, on a Thursday: thirteen jobs in flight.

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:10,900
The pipeline as one table: the stage, the next due date, the owner.

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:15,900
Open a job and the whole of it is on one page.

4
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:20,900
Permitting and procurement are closed. Installation is the live phase.

5
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:26,900
Every task names an owner, a date, and what it waits on.

6
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:32,900
The photographs are filed against the job, not left on a phone.

7
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:38,900
Then the company work list: overdue first, then everything else.

8
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:44,400
Deposits, progress payments and balances sit on the job they bill.

9
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:51,400
And the panel layout lives here too, ready to send.
